X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=97729911215190

Thanks,

The answer from Olle Eriksson <olle@cb.uu.se> was:

The Alphastation 255 cannot hold both ARC and SRM, only one of them.
You will need to reload the firmware and load SRM, NOT the AlphaBIOS.
The flashmemory is too small to hold both of them.

Thanks for the very quick response

Horst Lenk

