Original problem was that our Alpha DS20E with Tru64 UNIX 4.0F did not 
see our new AIT library. Solution was extremely easy. Tru64 4.0F does 
not accept SCSI IDs above 6. So I changed IDs of the library from 13 and 
14 to 2 and 3. That was it.

